+// Prototype: hardware ray queries (wgpu's EXPERIMENTAL_RAY_QUERY). Shaders use
+// `enable wgpu_ray_query;` and bind a GPUTlas as `acceleration_structure`.
+
+// Bottom-level acceleration structure: triangle geometry.
